SUMMARY:Startup & Business Networking in Toronto
DESCRIPTION:AI Startup Networking & Founder Pitch Night | Toronto \n \nJoin founders\, investors\, and AI professionals for an evening of curated networking\, startup pitches\, and industry discussions in Toronto. \n \nThis event is part of the Ascent Valley ecosystem — a global community connecting founders\, innovators\, and investors through curated events and collaborative opportunities. \n \nThe evening is designed to facilitate meaningful connections within the local and international startup ecosystem\, with a focus on artificial intelligence\, technology\, and early-stage innovation. \n \nWhat to Expect \n \n• Structured networking sessions with founders\, investors\, and operators   \n• Startup pitch presentations from selected AI and tech founders   \n• Open discussions on product development\, fundraising\, and growth   \n• Opportunities to connect with professionals across the startup ecosystem   \n \nWho Should Attend \n \n• AI startup founders and entrepreneurs   \n• Investors\, venture capitalists\, and angel investors   \n• Engineers and technology professionals   \n• Product managers and operators   \n• Individuals interested in the startup and innovation ecosystem   \n \nStartup Pitch Session \n \nA limited number of founders will be selected to present their startup to an audience of peers and investors. Each presentation will include a short pitch followed by a Q&A session and feedback. \n \nFounders interested in presenting may apply in advance. Selected participants will be confirmed prior to the event. \n \nInvestor Participation \n \nInvestors are invited to attend and connect with emerging startups and founders. Participation includes access to curated introductions and opportunities to engage with the local startup community. \n \nAbout Ascent Valley \n \nAscent Valley is a global ecosystem focused on connecting founders\, investors\, and professionals through curated networking events and startup-focused gatherings. The initiative supports collaboration\, knowledge exchange\, and long-term relationship building across international startup communities.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/startup-business-networking-in-toronto/
LOCATION:Gatherings Restobar\, 49 Saint Clair Avenue West\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M4V 3A5
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Science & Tech
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/startup-business-networking-in-toronto.png
END:VEVENT
