SUMMARY:VIVID #2: A New Indie-Electronic Event Series
DESCRIPTION:VIVID #2: A New Indie-Electronic Event Series \nVIVID is a monthly series at BSMT254 exploring the crossover between live instrumentation and electronic music. Following a successful March debut\, VIVID #2 returns on April 29th. \nFeaturing: \nAniqa Dear: Experimental electronic pop with Pakistani/Arabic influences. \nDifferent Dream: Cinematic indie-electro with live guitars/drums. \nTed Kennedy: Atmospheric synth-wave inspired by 80s cinema. \nVisuals: Immersive visuals by VJ Alex Melvin. \nJoin us for an immersive night of hybrid sounds and synchronized visuals in the heart of the West End.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/vivid-2-a-new-indie-electronic-event-series/
