SUMMARY:Zombocalypse!
DESCRIPTION:Eldritch Theatre presents\nZombocalypse!\nDirected by Ric WaughDesigned by Melanie McNeillCreated by Eric WoolfeStarring: Craig Lauzon\, Patrice Goodman\, Lisa Norton\, Kimwun Perehinec & Eric Woolfe \nThe Dead rise from their graves to feast on the flesh of the living in a suburban high school in 1985. A jock\, a brain\, a rebel\, a preppie and a basket-case barricade themselves in their school cafeteria to fend off the gathering hoards of their hungry\, undead friends\, only to discover that their real enemies are each other. \nIt’s totally the Breakfast Club\, but like with Zombies.
